      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3462,
        "name": "米卡",
        "desc": "<p>平凡家庭出身的年轻骑士，在小队中担任「前进测绘员」一职。为人低调，谨小慎微。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/20/47826599/da13e3b1a2c6c0e5892b201cec735f9b_1268190137665516330.png",
